       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20210415/sp-20210415-img-15.png?w=991&hash=100426C6B8C6ABA56AD3FEE9A94513E3" alt="Figure 15. The gaps in unemployment rates between Blacks and whites and between Hispanics and whites narrowed over the last expansion but remain wide" sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20210415/sp-20210415-img-15.png?w=991&amp;hash=100426C6B8C6ABA56AD3FEE9A94513E3 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20210415/sp-20210415-img-15.png?w=800&amp;hash=DA6B9FACAB03E4CED80D3F86C5086F77 800w" />
    </figure>

</div>
</div>
