            <figcaption>
                
                Some of the rise in homeownership rates in 2020 may reflect issues with data collection during the pandemic. There remain wide racial gaps in homeownership rates.
            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20210415/sp-20210415-img-16.png?w=991&hash=A7B8E8235A4605D43C565295AB6A1CC5" alt="Figure 16. Some of the rise in homeownership rates in 2020 may reflect issues with data collection during the pandemic. There remain wide racial gaps in homeownership rates." sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20210415/sp-20210415-img-16.png?w=991&amp;hash=A7B8E8235A4605D43C565295AB6A1CC5 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20210415/sp-20210415-img-16.png?w=800&amp;hash=3978941DD58353075214713FFA7A03E8 800w" />
