            <figcaption>
                
                There remain racial gaps in access to credit
            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20210415/sp-20210415-img-17.png?w=991&hash=7D8B2D70EA4057E33B3332F9A8010CAE" alt="Figure 17. There remain racial gaps in access to credit" sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20210415/sp-20210415-img-17.png?w=991&amp;hash=7D8B2D70EA4057E33B3332F9A8010CAE 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20210415/sp-20210415-img-17.png?w=800&amp;hash=B7971BA6F5A1989DF91A3BE909F532E5 800w" />
