    <li>            Choi, Jung Hyun, &ldquo;Breaking Down the Black-White Homeownership Gap,&rdquo; <em>Urban Wire: Housing and Housing Finance </em>(blog), Urban Institute, February 21, 2020.<br />
    (<a rel="noopener noreferrer" class="offsite" href="https://www.urban.org/urban-wire/breaking-down-black-white-homeownership-gap" target="_blank">https://www.urban.org/urban-wire/breaking-down-black-white-homeownership-gap</a>)        </li>
